            "text": "<ul><li><strong>Grooming Brush: </strong>Used to clean floating hair and dander, making the hair more healthy, shiny, and soft.</li><li><strong>Deshedding Brush: </strong>Used to remove the pet's long and unnecessary thick hair.</li><li><strong>Electric Clipper: </strong>Used to trim the pet's hair without leaving a mess, as the hair will not fly around.</li><li><strong>Long Narrow Nozzle: </strong>Used to clean carpet, sofa corners, car, cat tree and cat nest.</li><li><strong>Round Blow Nozzle: </strong>Used to blow dry the under coat or small area quick dry.</li><li><strong>Narrow Blow Nozzle:</strong>Concentrates air flow for large area hair drying.</li><li><strong>Pet Hair Remover Roller: </strong>Effectively remove pet hair that stuck to clothing.</li><li><strong>Crevice Tool: </strong>Used to clean hair on the furniture and hard-to-reach areas.</li><li><strong>Install Guide Comb: </strong>Used with electric clippers.</li></ul>"
          }
        },
